#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can keep a zone clear of raindrops with the\n"
"'Select' tool? Selecting the area to avoid (for example a face) before\n"
"launching the 'RainDrops' filter will keep it free from rain drops.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<imgsrc=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"តើ​អ្នក​ដឹង​ទេ​ថា ​អ្នក​អាច​រក្សា​​ផ្ទៃ​​​ស្អាត​មួយ​នៃ​​តំណក់​​ភ្លៀង​ជា​មួយ​នឹង\n"
"ឧបករណ៍ 'ជ្រើស' ? ដោយ​ជ្រើស​ផ្ទៃ​​ដើម្បី​ជៀសវាង (ឧ. ផ្ទៃមុខ) មុននឹង\n"
"ចាប់​ផ្ដើម​តម្រង 'តំណក់​ភ្លៀង' នឹង​​ទុក​​វា​មិន​ឲ្យ​ប៉ះពាល់​ដោយ​​តំណក់​ភ្លៀង ។\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can simulate the graininess of black-and-white photos "
"with the 'FilmGrain' image editor plugin.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"តើ​អ្នក​បាន​ដឹង​ទេ​ថា ​អ្នក​អាច​ក្លែង​​ផ្ទៃ​​រូបថត​​ស-ខ្មៅ​ជាមួយ​នឹង​កម្មវិធី​​​​ជំនួយ​កម្មវិធី​និពន្ធ​រូបភាព​របស់ ​'FilmGrain' ។\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

